227 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 120 0 R
/E (The Web-Based Driven HIV Patient Record, Case Tracking, and Treatment Access System for LoveYourself HIV Treatment Hubs is a secure web application developed to improve the management of HIV-related healthcare services. The system enables clinic personnel to efficiently manage patient records, appointments, treatment information, case tracking, and educational resources through a centralized platform. It also allows users to conveniently access healthcare services, schedule appointments, monitor treatment information, and receive important notifications online.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
228 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 120 0 R
/E (The system supports multiple user roles with different levels of access, ensuring that sensitive medical information is only accessible to authorized personnel. It also incorporates security mechanisms such as role-based access control and One-Time Password \(OTP\) verification to help protect confidential patient data. Additionally, the system includes an AI-powered chatbot that provides HIV-related educational information and assists users in navigating the system.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
